BetterAltay-Go

This project is a Go rewrite of BetterAltay, a Minecraft: Bedrock Edition
server derived from PocketMine-MP and Altay.

Source references:
- BetterAltay: https://github.com/Benedikt05/BetterAltay
- PocketMine-MP: https://github.com/pmmp/PocketMine-MP
- Altay: https://github.com/unresolved3169/Altay

The current rewrite uses BetterAltay's observed behavior, protocol constants,
configuration conventions and module boundaries as implementation references.
The initial protocol baseline is Minecraft Bedrock 1.26.10, protocol 944.

